// D&D's "Armor of Agathys": a temp-HP shell (modeled with `Shielded`, the
// same absorb-pool primitive false_life.ron already uses for temporary hit
// points) that in the source spell also bites back with cold damage against
// any melee attacker while it holds. That retaliation/thorns rider is
// dropped -- this engine has no reflect-damage-to-attacker primitive
// (checked every BuffKind in common/src/comp/buff.rs) -- same "no fitting
// primitive, ships without the rider" call N76-I made for chill_touch's
// anti-healing rider. Ships as the temp-HP shell alone.
SelfBuff(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    buffs: [
        BuffDesc(kind: Shielded, data: BuffData(strength: 15.0, duration: Some(3600.0))),
    ],
    energy_cost: 30.0,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
